msgid "SmallRye Metrics"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The following guide demonstrates how a Quarkus application can use link:https://github.com/smallrye/smallrye-metrics/[SmallRye Metrics],\n"
"an implementation of the link:https://github.com/eclipse/microprofile-metrics/[MicroProfile Metrics] specification."
msgstr ""

msgid "SmallRye Metrics allows applications to gather metrics and statistics that provide insights into what is happening inside an application. The metrics can be read remotely using the JSON or OpenMetrics format to be processed by additional tools such as Prometheus and stored for analysis and visualization."
msgstr ""

msgid "Apart from application-specific metrics described in this guide, you may also use built-in metrics exposed by various Quarkus extensions. These are described in the guide for each particular extension that supports built-in metrics."
msgstr ""

msgid "xref:telemetry-micrometer.adoc[Micrometer] is the recommended approach to metrics for Quarkus. Use the SmallRye Metrics extension when it is required to retain MicroProfile specification compatibility."
msgstr ""

msgid "When Quarkus will upgrade to Eclipse MicroProfile 6, the SmallRye Metrics support will be discontinued."
msgstr ""

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr "Essa tecnologia é considerada {extension-status}."

msgid "Being _deprecated_ means that this extension is likely to be replaced or removed in a future version of Quarkus."
msgstr "Ser _deprecated_ significa que essa extensão provavelmente será substituída ou removida em uma versão futura do Quarkus."

msgid "For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr "Para obter uma lista completa de possíveis status, consulte nosso https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ]."

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Pré-requisitos"

msgid "To complete this guide, you need:"
msgstr "Para concluir este guia, você precisa:"

msgid "Roughly 15 minutes"
msgstr "Cerca de 15 minutos"

msgid "An IDE"
msgstr "Um IDE"

msgid "JDK 17+ installed with `JAVA_HOME` configured appropriately"
msgstr "JDK 17+ instalado com `JAVA_HOME` configurado corretamente"

msgid "Apache Maven {maven-version}"
msgstr "Apache Maven {maven-version}"

msgid "Optionally the xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] if you want to use it"
msgstr "Opcionalmente, o xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] se você quiser usá-lo"

msgid "Optionally Mandrel or GraalVM installed and xref:building-native-image.adoc#configuring-graalvm[configured appropriately] if you want to build a native executable (or Docker if you use a native container build)"
msgstr "Opcionalmente, Mandrel ou GraalVM instalado e xref:building-native-image.adoc#configuring-graalvm[configurado apropriadamente] se você quiser criar um executável nativo (ou Docker se você usar uma compilação de contêiner nativo)"

msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Arquitetura"

msgid "In this example, we build a very simple microservice that offers one REST endpoint. This endpoint serves for determining whether a number is prime. The implementation class is annotated with certain metric annotations so that while responding to users' requests, certain metrics are gathered. The meaning of each metric is explained later."
msgstr ""

